{
    "info": {
        "name": "PC 財產管理系統 API",
        "description": "財產管理系統的固定資產相關 API\n\n## 環境變數說明\n- `devUrl`: API 基礎網址 (預設: http://localhost:8000)\n- `jwtToken`: JWT 認證 Token (Bearer Token)\n- `assetId`: 資產ID (用於測試)\n- `assetNumber`: 財產編號 (用於測試)\n\n## 模組說明\nPC (Property Control) 財產管理模組提供完整的固定資產管理功能，包含：\n- 固定資產新增、修改、刪除、查詢\n- 異動記錄追蹤\n- 資產移轉作業\n- 折舊計算與管理\n- 資產處置作業\n- 編碼管理\n\n## 資料表關係\n- pc_fixed_assets: 固定資產主表\n- pc_asset_transaction_details: 異動記錄明細表\n- pc_asset_transfers: 資產移轉作業表\n- pc_depreciation_operations: 折舊作業表\n- pc_depreciation_datas: 折舊資料表\n- pc_asset_disposals: 資產處置作業表\n- pc_encoding_categories: 編碼類別表\n- pc_encoding_items: 編碼項目表\n- pc_encoding_rules: 編碼規則表",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
        "version": "2.0.0"
    },
    "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [
            {
                "key": "token",
                "value": "{{jwtToken}}",
                "type": "string"
            }
        ]
    },
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "固定資產管理",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "1. 取得固定資產列表",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{devUrl}}/api/pc/assets?page=1&perPage=15",
                            "host": [
                                "{{devUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "pc",
                                "assets"
                            ],
                            "query": [
                                {
                                    "key": "page",
                                    "value": "1",
                                    "description": "頁碼"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "perPage",
                                    "value": "15",
                                    "description": "每頁筆數 (使用 'all' 可取得全部)"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "## 取得固定資產列表\n\n**功能說明：** 取得固定資產分頁列表\n\n**查詢參數：**\n- `page`: 頁碼 (預設: 1)\n- `perPage`: 每頁筆數 (預設: 15)，設為 'all' 可取得全部資料"
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "2. 搜尋固定資產",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{devUrl}}/api/pc/assets/search?keyword=電腦",
                            "host": [
                                "{{devUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "pc",
                                "assets",
                                "search"
                            ],
                            "query": [
                                {
                                    "key": "keyword",
                                    "value": "電腦",
                                    "description": "搜尋關鍵字 (財產編號、名稱或規格)"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "## 搜尋固定資產\n\n**功能說明：** 根據關鍵字搜尋固定資產 (搜尋財產編號、財產名稱或規格)\n\n**查詢參數：**\n- `keyword`: 搜尋關鍵字 (必填)\n\n**使用範例：**\n- 搜尋電腦: `keyword=電腦`\n- 搜尋財產編號: `keyword=FA-2024`"
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "3. 取得財產編號列表",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{devUrl}}/api/pc/assets/numbers/list?search=FA&limit=100",
                            "host": [
                                "{{devUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "pc",
                                "assets",
                                "numbers",
                                "list"
                            ],
                            "query": [
                                {
                                    "key": "search",
                                    "value": "FA",
                                    "description": "搜尋關鍵字 (選填)",
                                    "disabled": true
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "limit",
                                    "value": "100",
                                    "description": "最多回傳筆數 (預設: 100)",
                                    "disabled": true
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "## 取得財產編號列表\n\n**功能說明：** 取得所有財產編號的列表 (用於下拉選單)\n\n**查詢參數：**\n- `search`: 搜尋關鍵字 (選填)\n- `limit`: 最多回傳筆數 (預設: 100)"
                    },
                    "response": []
